<title>NAMIBIA: SOCCER-DRAW FOR COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DRAW FOR COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the final group matches of the new Cosafa Castle Cup for teams in the southern African region.</p>
<p>Each team will play two home and two away matches with the winner decided on points. No venues have yet been decided:</p>
<p>Malawi v Mozambique, April 12</p>
<p>Zambia v Malawi, April 20</p>
<p>Tanzania v Namibia, May 31</p>
<p>Mozambique v Tanzania, June 15</p>
<p>Namibia v Malawi, June 28</p>
<p>Tanzania v Zambia, July 5</p>
<p>Mozambique v Namibia, July 20</p>
<p>Zambia v Mozambique, August 2</p>
<p>Malawi v Tanzania, August 9</p>
<p>Namibia v Zambia, August 30</p>
</text>
